    "AlarmDescription": "Agent machines had 200 or more website lookups blocked by the DNS firewall in 5 minutes. Check the DNS firewall log /agentx/staging/dns-firewall for the blocked names and the source addresses, and check which workspaces were running. A tool that needs a site not on the allowlist is the usual cause; add it with the agentxEgressAllowDomains context if it is legitimate.",
